  "label": "Social Media Content Reporting",
  "description": "The text 'i get reported all the fuckin time' refers to the real-world phenomenon of content moderation on social media platforms, where users can report posts (including memes) for violating community guidelines. This system is often criticized for being inconsistent or overly aggressive, and the meme humorously expresses the frustration of creators who feel their content is unfairly flagged. This concept is not visible in the image but is essential to understanding the meme’s message.",
